Author: BinguRecorder

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatible with this plugin (empty for all)

Title: BinguRecorder

Summary: Screen recorder

Description: |
  Records the game screen to the SD card as an .avi video.

  Open the plugin menu with Select, or press L + R + Down
  in game to start and stop recording.
  Videos are saved in sd:/BinguRecorder/

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
